---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Sébastien Boulnois, PhD | Human Factors & Human-Systems Integration Engineer
description: Human factors and HSI engineer with a PhD in aviation human-centered design, cockpit simulator research with airline pilots, and nuclear plant field studies. US citizen, eligible for Secret/TS.
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.title }}</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">I turn operator performance data into design requirements engineers can build.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">PhD in aviation human-centered design. Cockpit simulator studies with airline pilots, nuclear plant field research, and five years of applied research at scale. Now returning to safety-critical systems.</p>
      <ul class="status-list" aria-label="Availability">
        <li class="status-list__item">US citizen, eligible for Secret/TS</li>
        <li class="status-list__item">Palmdale or San Diego</li>
        <li class="status-list__item">Available now</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ site.resume }}">Download resume <span class="button__meta">(PDF)</span></a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email me</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <picture class="hero__portrait">
      <source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/images/sebastien-boulnois-portrait-480.webp 480w, assets/images/sebastien-boulnois-portrait-700.webp 700w" sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 22rem, 80vw">
      <img src="assets/images/sebastien-boulnois-portrait-480.jpg" srcset="assets/images/sebastien-boulnois-portrait-480.jpg 480w, assets/images/sebastien-boulnois-portrait-700.jpg 700w" sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 22rem, 80vw" class="hero__image" width="480" height="600" alt="Sébastien presenting research findings at a whiteboard.">
    </picture>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="figures" aria-label="Key figures">
  <ul class="container figures__list">
    <li class="figures__item">
      <span class="figures__value">15</span>
      <span class="figures__label">expert airline pilots in three years of cockpit research</span>
    </li>
    <li class="figures__item">
      <span class="figures__value">3</span>
      <span class="figures__label">nuclear power plants studied in the field</span>
    </li>
    <li class="figures__item">
      <span class="figures__value">8</span>
      <span class="figures__label">publications in human factors venues</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__title" id="work-title">Selected work</h2>
    <ul class="case-list">
      {%- for case in work %}
      <li class="case-card">
        <p class="case-card__meta">{{ case.context }} · {{ case.years }}</p>
        <h3 class="case-card__title">
          {%- if case.url %}<a class="case-card__link" href="{{ case.url }}">{{ case.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ case.title }}{% endif -%}
        </h3>
        <p class="case-card__summary">{{ case.summary }}</p>
        <ul class="tag-list" aria-label="Highlights">
          {%- for fact in case.facts %}
          <li class="tag-list__item">{{ fact }}</li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt" aria-labelledby="methods-title">
  <div class="container media-split">
    <div class="media-split__text">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="methods-title">How I work</h2>
      <dl class="method-list">
        <div class="method-list__item">
          <dt class="method-list__term">Human performance measurement</dt>
          <dd class="method-list__detail">Workload, situation awareness and usability, measured with NASA-TLX, SART and SUS.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="method-list__item">
          <dt class="method-list__term">Human-in-the-loop test</dt>
          <dd class="method-list__detail">Scenario design and pilot-in-the-loop studies in Boeing 737 and Airbus A320 simulators.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="method-list__item">
          <dt class="method-list__term">Cognitive task analysis</dt>
          <dd class="method-list__detail">Expert interviews and field observation to find where decisions break down.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="method-list__item">
          <dt class="method-list__term">Human-machine teaming</dt>
          <dd class="method-list__detail">Levels of automation and shared awareness between operators and robotic agents.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <figure class="media-split__figure">
      <picture>
        <source type="image/webp" srcset="assets/images/b737-simulator-study-800.webp 800w, assets/images/b737-simulator-study-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 34rem, 92vw">
        <img src="assets/images/b737-simulator-study-800.jpg" srcset="assets/images/b737-simulator-study-800.jpg 800w, assets/images/b737-simulator-study-1600.jpg 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 34rem, 92vw" class="media-split__image" width="800" height="532" loading="lazy" alt="Sébastien running a study session with a participant at the controls of a Boeing 737 cockpit simulator.">
      </picture>
      <figcaption class="media-split__caption">Pilot-in-the-loop testing in a Boeing 737 simulator, Florida Tech.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">
    <h2 class="section__title section__title--compact" id="about-title">About</h2>
    <p>My PhD and early career were in aviation human factors: cockpit simulators, pilot decision-making and nuclear plant field studies. I then spent five years in applied research for Fortune 500 clients, learning to deliver findings that engineers and executives act on.</p>
    <p>In 2024 I took a planned break to care for my young children. I’m now returning to the work I trained for: systems where human performance has real consequences.</p>
    <p class="prose__note">Supported the INCOSE Human-Systems Integration Workshop, 2015–2018. French (native) and English.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
